      "content": "Body weights were recorded on Day 1 and weekly thereafter through Day 28.\n\n**Male Mean Body Weights (g):**\n| Group | Day 1 | Day 28 |\n| G1 | 301.4 | 352.8 |\n| G4 | 299.1 | 288.6 |\n\nAt Day 28, Group 4 males were -18.2% relative to controls. These differences were statistically significant (p < 0.01, Dunnett's test) and are considered treatment related. The magnitude of the decrement is regarded as adverse at this dose level."
